 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Arika - The Woman Who Took Everything From Me"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Yukari Shiradaira, a successful advertising professional in Tokyo, finally feels fulfilled in her career and is about to marry her workplace sweetheart. Life seems perfect—until Arika Fūrin, a junior from her high school and college days, suddenly transfers to her company.\nA Shocking Reunion: \"Long time no see!\" Arika greets her cheerfully, but Yukari is frozen. Their past ended in unresolved conflict, and Yukari had deliberately cut ties after graduation.\nUnwanted Proximity: Yukari tries to avoid Arika at work, but Arika ignores her boundaries, invading her space with relentless friendliness. Is it reconciliation… or revenge?\nThe Confidant: Yukari turns to Ren Takanashi, her designer best friend, for advice—only to realize Ren might know more about Arika’s motives than she lets on."
  },
